WEBVTT

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:39.760
Ah, good morning!

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:45.270
Sorry, I started breakfast without you since you were sound asleep.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:48.900
Raw ramen tastes quite good, doesn't it?

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:54.150
It looks like Keita-kun...

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:57.320
is still emotionally depressed.

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:01.700
I must make sure that he rests well this Saturday.

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:05.500
Thank goodness. It seems that you have recovered.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:06.330
You...

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:09.290
It seems like our hearts are highly compatible.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:11.800
It was quite dangerous earlier, but you should be okay now.

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:14.760
What do you mean by "compatible?"

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:20.970
However, don't leave my side for a few days.

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:26.640
My heart will become necrotic

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:30.110
if it gets too far away from the main body before it completely integrates into you.

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:33.320
Then, this heart is...?

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:34.940
Yup, it's mine.

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:38.820
Keita-kun, I'm coming in.

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:39.950
Ah, wait!

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.950
Keita-san, look, your heart is over here.

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:45.950
We formed a contract.

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:46.960
Crap...

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:47.960
Good morning, Keita-kun-

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:50.250
My savior!

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:54.960
Just what is going on in here...?

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:57.260
Suddenly...

00:01:57.260 --> 00:01:59.130
this unbelievable reality...

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:02.890
began to slowly destroy my daily life.

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:11.900
Can you sense anything, Excel?

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:15.480
There is an unusual amount of Tera everywhere.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:19.660
This means that Master Roots are being mass produced.

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:21.490
Who is he and why is he doing this?

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:24.490
We have no choice but to investigate.

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:28.660
Let the Tera I sense guide us to the source.

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:31.500
"Synchro"

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:41.010
Keita-san, I'm sorry about eating your bento.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:43.930
It's okay. I'm not hungry anyway.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:47.270
Well, I didn't really understand the important part, but...

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:51.520
Basically, a contract is formed by exchanging body parts.

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:52.940
Contract?

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:55.770
By rule, I should only form a contract with a chosen human,

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:57.940
but I did it to save Keita-san.

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:00.490
If both members of the contract synchro,

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:02.610
then they will be able to activate an incredible power.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:10.000
We, Mototsumitama, are more durable and stronger than humans.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.710
Moto... tsumitama?

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:16.250
Yes.  We are an existence different from humans who live in another world.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:19.800
It's great that our hearts were exchanged without any problems.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:22.720
What are you saying?

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:24.970
Hearts are not something that you exchange...

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:28.680
You didn't see the scar on my chest?

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:32.980
But that isn't enough proof...

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:34.730
In that case, if you want additional proof...

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.730
Look, Keita-san has one, too.

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:41.400
Enough already.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:44.740
You're scaring Akane-san.

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:50.790
H-H-Hot!

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:54.960
Are you okay?

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:55.920
Yes.

00:03:56.380 --> 00:04:00.670
Keita-kun, did she really save your life?

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:03.840
Well, you can put it that way.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:07.180
There isn't a need for you to think about how to repay me for it.

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:10.470
After all, I was the source of the trouble.

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:12.060
It's all your fault!

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.610
You will just get carried away if I remain quiet and listen.

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.570
I beg of you, just go somewhere else.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:20.610
Keita-kun...

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.170
Erm... Kuro-chan, right?

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.330
Why don't you go and take a bath?

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:41.380
Keita-kun, are you really okay?

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:43.130
Does your chest hurt?

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:44.050
I'm fine.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:47.050
Go to the hospital on Monday.

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:52.100
Seiji was defeated?

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:52.810
Yes.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:57.310
It serves him right. He kept boasting about how he defeated four Mototsumitama.

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:01.730
But a Mototsumitama powerful enough to defeat Seiji is...

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:03.320
That girl is...

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:06.320
There's no mistake.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:23.090
Oops, I used to much power.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:27.590
Oh well, there are a lot of people who wish to be Tribal Ends anyway.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:29.890
Find her immediately.

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:31.600
Yes, sir. I'll definitely find her.

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:38.350
I finally get to see you, my dear Kuro.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:48.990
Hello, this is Ibuki.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.160
It's me, Tsubouda. I'm sorry about calling you on your day off.

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.990
Oh, Sensei? What's wrong?

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:58.000
I received a call that one of my students was caught in a fight last night,

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.130
so I was a bit worried.

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:03.250
I'm okay.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.550
Are you alone right now?

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:05.630
Erm...

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:08.300
Want to get something to eat? I'm in your area right now.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:11.140
You probably don't eat well since you are living alone.

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:13.310
Actually, I'm with a friend right now—

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:14.890
Keita-kun, can I borrow this?

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.140
Who's that?

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:17.890
I-It's a childhood friend.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:20.400
Oh? I see.

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:22.610
Be careful then.

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:24.190
Bye.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:27.280
Ah, that was refreshing.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:30.570
It felt great since I haven't taken a bath in a long time.

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.450
Thanks.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.450
Kuro-chan, let's go somewhere else to change.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:39.210
Why?

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:41.420
Just do as I say.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.000
Time to go back to sleep.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.800
Kuro-chan, aren't you tired?

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:49.720
Why don't you lie down?

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.220
Erm...

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.220
What is it?

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:55.720
I want to sleep with Keita-san, but...

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:56.720
Eh?

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:01.980
Since we just formed a contract, the balance of our combat abilities is in a mess.

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:06.980
If we don't fix the synchro between us, my abilities will begin to drop.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:11.610
I want to synchro well with Keita-san. That's why I—

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:13.280
B-But you can't sleep together!

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:15.280
I'll stay over tonight.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:23.540
Are you Keita-san's girlfriend?

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.040
Erm...

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.800
Or are you his servant because he's a great person?

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:29.550
You are mistaken.

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:31.380
We're childhood friends.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.300
I've known him since he was very little.

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.430
I see.

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:36.430
Here you go.

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:39.680
Can I eat all all of them?

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:41.180
Yes, of course.

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:43.520
Yay! I'm going to eat them!

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.530
To think that such a thing happened...

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.530
It's unbelievable.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:07.000
Is this really your first time riding this?

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.300
Yes. I'm very thankful for this.

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:12.130
I was only able to look up at it from below.

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:14.800
Keita-kun, are you okay?

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:17.140
Yeah. I had a good nap.

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:18.970
Actually, why do I have to come along?

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.720
I have exams tomorrow.

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:24.310
Keita-san, you must stay close to me right now.

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:29.150
I-Isn't it better to maintain some distance?

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:31.650
By the way, where are we going?

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:37.160
Kuro-chan, we're going to buy some clothes for you since the ones you were wearing are ruined.

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:40.740
We don't need to do that much for her.

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:44.460
She is the reason that I got into so much trouble.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:50.300
Erm... Akane-san...

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.420
What is it?

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:54.470
What kind of person is Keita-san?

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:55.180
Eh?

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:59.390
Right now, I can't do without him.

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:01.680
You "can't do without him..."

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:04.680
Sometimes, he's really nice to me, but the other times, he's really cold.

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:07.940
I don't really know much about him.

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:13.150
Even though it doesn't seem like it, Keita-kun actually has a warm heart.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:17.160
It's just that he's a bit stubborn and not very honest about his feelings.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.950
That's why everyone has a bad impression of him.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:21.080
But I understand him.

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:23.500
I see. That's why.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:27.460
Then, I need to spend time to slowly work on him!

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:31.090
Work on him... What do you mean?!

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:39.090
There are so many clothes here!

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:42.100
Go ahead. Choose something you like.

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:48.100
You look cute!

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.230
That suits you.

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.280
That's not really suitable for daily use...

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:56.490
That suits you.

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:02.870
That might be bit too provocative...

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:04.450
That suits you.

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:11.040
Thank you very much.

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:11.880
It's okay.

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:19.550
What's wrong, Excel?

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:22.890
I could momentarily sense a powerful Tera.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:25.640
One from a Mototsumitama.

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:27.060
What?

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:32.980
Go drop by the hospital just in case.

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:34.020
Got it.

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.690
I'm off then.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:56.840
Keita-san, you should eat breakfast to replenish your energy.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:58.090
I'm heading out, too.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.090
O-Okay.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:00.130
Going to the hospital?

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:01.430
I'm going to school.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:02.470
School?

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:05.760
Didn't Akane-san tell you to go to the hospital?

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:07.810
How am I going to explain to the doctor if I do go there?

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:09.770
There's no way he'll believe me, right?

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:13.150
But it's better that we stay together for now...

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.980
I'll be back in the afternoon.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:17.860
Listen up. Don't step out of the apartment until I return.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.380
Is the production of Master Roots going well?

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:37.880
Hiyou-sama...

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:42.880
This is a bit rude, but please don't show up here often.

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:46.970
Don't get carried away just because Reishin-sama likes you.

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:52.390
Don't forget that if you lose the power of us, the Shishigami clan,

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:55.110
you are just someone who is lucky.

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:08.700
...given the power of the Shishigami clan...

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.410
The Shishigami clan...

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:12.160
Brother...

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:19.340
I know that Keita used it,

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:22.760
Those bound by a contract share their hearts and even their towels!

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:28.260
We have been searching for you, stray Mototsumitama.

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:31.270
Will you come with us?

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:33.730
Tribal End...

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:40.690
You can't fight well since you just formed a contract, right?

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:00.000
What? That's it?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.920
Let us have more fun with you.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:03.920
My strength...

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:06.680
It's as if this isn't my body...

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:13.600
What?

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:15.560
What's this pain that I'm feeling?

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.320
This should be enough already. Let's leave her as she is.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:30.120
My sense of balance is completely off in battle.

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:33.790
I can't fight properly if this goes on.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:36.460
Now, come with us obediently.

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:46.880
Oh my!

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:48.260
Shit!

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.230
What just happened?

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:59.440
Did something happen to Kuro?

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:00.940
Ibuki?

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:04.150
I have something to talk to you about.

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:05.820
Erm... I'm in a hurry...

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:10.070
It's about the Doppeliner system that you were talking about the other day.

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:14.330
I want to save you.

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:28.340
Erm, Sensei...

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:29.930
Calm down.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:37.600
At first, I didn't believe that such a system exists either...

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:45.940
But I think it's wonderful that only those with the best luck survives.

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:53.370
Wouldn't we be able to build an ideal society if the world is ruled by those who are chosen?

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:55.870
Sensei...

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:10.010
You should contribute something to the ideal society too.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:15.260
Doing that will lead you to the path that will save you.

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:25.610
Keita-san!

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:28.190
Why are you here?

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:30.030
Didn't I tell you to stay at home?

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:32.490
Thank goodness that you are okay.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:35.330
Tribal Ends came to your home.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:36.240
What did you just say?

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:39.500
What's wrong, Kuro?

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.000
He's a Tribal End, too.

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:48.210
Don't say such crazy things.

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:50.210
No. Kuro is telling the tru—

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:54.760
So Ibuki really <i>is</i> the one who formed a contract with her.

00:15:57.560 --> 00:16:01.020
I'll have you two stay here until they come to pick you up.

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:15.530
So, a Mototsumitama who just formed a contract is <i>this</i> weak?

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.530
S-Sensei...

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:22.120
Stop resisting!

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:42.100
Sensei, what is going on?

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:45.140
Ibuki, thank goodness that you are my student.

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:48.860
My value will rise once I hand this girl over.

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.630
Hey, where are you going?!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.090
Ibuki!

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:21.640
Keita-san, thanks a lot.

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:29.400
I won't let you escape.

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.660
Keita-san, I'll fight.

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.250
That's why our hearts must become one.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:46.790
Please synchro with me.

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:48.920
Synchro? How?

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:52.420
Be prepared to fight and have the will to defeat your enemy.

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:54.920
Prepared... to fight?

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:57.430
I won't let you synchro!

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:11.560
Kuro!

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.570
Sensei, please stop this!

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:21.070
Ibuki, step aside.

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.490
What a pity.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:31.080
I was looking forward to the possibility that you might become a complete Root, a Master Root.

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:36.460
You are different from monkeys like Yamada.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:43.720
She may not have been a good student, but she was of use to society.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:48.480
She contributed to the production of a Master Root.

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:56.860
Don't tell me that you leaked out information about your students in order to create those Master Root things?!

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.820
Kuro, defeat him.

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:06.740
Defeat... him.

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:07.500
Okay.

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:28.770
Synchro!

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:39.440
Hmph, you performed synchro?

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:43.740
However, you don't have any strength left to fight!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:52.500
Amazing...

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:55.590
The feeling of Tera overflowing in my body...

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:58.300
Go, Kuro!

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:01.300
This is the power of... synchro!

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:20.030
I can no longer return.

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:25.030
Is continuing to fight the only way left to survive in this world?

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:26.280
This is the first frame of the ED

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:44.510
As it thaws my frozen body, before we realize it, dawn arrives.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:44.510
Itsu Shika Asa wo Mukae Itetsuku Karada Tokete

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:55.940
I've returned from my untimely death with my awakened memories.

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:55.940
Sameta Kioku de Hayasugita Shi wo Kaeshite

00:20:56.230 --> 00:21:08.240
The sounds of the bugs weeping, the sounds of the birds dancing in flight...

00:20:56.230 --> 00:21:08.240
Mushitachi no Naku Koe mo Toritachi no Mau Haoto ni mo

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:24.720
This soundless, white wasteland will be overflowing with their vivid colors.

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:24.720
Oto wo Nakushita Shiroki Kare Chi ni Afureru Iro wo Sosoide Iku Azayaka ni

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:28.590
Luck is power.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:32.100
The value of that power depends on how you use it.

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:39.610
